    "text": "For a function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math> (where&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer function), if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>,&nbsp;then",
